{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a72571ecf08ea83127abc48e72e6c1429c4403bdf3a156975799df65ae0060c6", "ja": "（これからエミリーのPV撮影が始まる……のだが）", "zh": "（接下来就要开始艾米莉的PV拍摄了……不过）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "18be685cf4f2648cb461d788704e86a752b16c6fa61f6fa200e5b671bea7c153", "ja": "むむ……少し太くなってしまったような……\nいつもと違うからか、線も自由に……ああ～！", "zh": "唔唔……好像变得稍微有点粗了……\n是因为和平时不同吗，线条也难以随心所欲……啊啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c1b9497b61363069798cb1deefcb5c225c42d2e7602256f23395cbe5de58ba17", "ja": "お疲れ様、エミリー。\nもうすぐ本番だけど、準備はいいか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。  \n马上就要正式演出了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "4740782de629eb6409fd3914da5a1e8cde9bf79290ee4f2b7dac8bdfcda52b8f", "ja": "Oh！　すみません、準備は大丈夫です。\n今はつい、絵の練習に夢中になってしまって……。", "zh": "Oh！对不起，我已经准备好了。\n刚才不小心画画练习得入迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1004_p", "source_sha256": "54bbc3d602f7d01d1e949111d54e50d70ea499044d540d5de1732a745756df02", "ja": "今日のPVでは、大きな絵を描くシーンがあるからな。\n随分と集中してたけど、何を描いてたんだ？", "zh": "今天的PV里有要画大幅画作的场景嘛。  \n你刚才特别专注，在画什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "945ff93481b47a400ce83769e22938b3a51cbc2499c9c8bd63081298fe5578a9", "ja": "はい、花や鳥などを少しだけ。\nそ、そうは見えないかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "嗯，画了一点花和鸟之类的。\n可、可能看不太出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a67ba7dc8cb9d4f4149360178d62907156c975066b1b1352f6aad98b17c7bee9", "ja": "なるほど。……よかったら、絵を描いていたノート、\nスタッフさんたちに見せてもいいか？", "zh": "原来如此。……如果你不介意的话，可以把画画用的笔记本给工作人员们看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "8bd9c059218b812f3f9c1035ef764db0e64caabee505e43e99ca7e5c3852d3c9", "ja": "ええっ！？　ですが、その……。", "zh": "诶！？可是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1b85c06062f748bc42c395144613498530023a954ff83277c98e7a02661d9fe9", "ja": "加工すれば、PVの演出にも使えるかもと思って。\nもちろん、世に出したくないならそれでも大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "我想，要是加工一下，说不定还能用在PV的演出上。\n当然，如果你不想让它公开，那也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "95fba3b87134e3103e826cd18f0ff64cf57f30b161bcc09662e7cb100780cc12", "ja": "…………。いえ、では……お願いいたしますっ。\nつたない絵ですけど、気持ちは込めたつもりですっ。", "zh": "…………。不，那么……就拜托您了！\n虽然画得还很拙劣，但我自认注入了满满的心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d8d4db8cc44f097c7b698e663bb8668b7e7004ad19465cc70e7be490fbb8beaa", "ja": "ありがとう。エミリーの気持ちをそのまま、\nみんなに感じてもらえそうに思ったんだ。", "zh": "谢谢。我觉得这样能让大家原原本本地感受到艾米莉的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "d72f2255d71034ddd6201ce78f1ca5ccafa3c120323c26e2d3329788abdf270d", "ja": "なるほど。そういうことでしたら……。\nお伝えできるかもしれません。", "zh": "原来如此。既然是这样……或许能够传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "381db02d95da91ef388ff820d38934731529d3b5762ff0c11692f099a96007b2", "ja": "帳面に描きながら、考えたんです。\n着物の模様を描くなら、どのようなものにしたいか。", "zh": "我一边在本子上画着，一边思考着。\n如果要画和服的花纹，自己会想画什么样的图案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "651d6a64047f2b22dee6a934bc611802e610e6c53857465210f5cc38ab4a16f1", "ja": "山や川などの美しい景色もいいのですが、\nやはり私は、大和撫子として、花鳥風月を……と。", "zh": "山川等优美的景色固然很好，\n但我觉得，既然身为大和抚子，还是应该选择花鸟风月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "04266e38254b505666468203aa35c8f2128e0c8fa7a82ecef92d2855d9349c62", "ja": "どこまでも咲き誇る花のように、\nどこまでも空を舞う鳥のように……。", "zh": "如同绽放到天涯海角的花朵，\n如同翱翔于无边天空的鸟儿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "007e59a303290bb1c7b49a50b78881b09f7d53af5d0b7c506403f98a0d20f21b", "ja": "私は、そんな大和撫子になりたいです♪", "zh": "我想成为那样的大和抚子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1016_p", "source_sha256": "67f4ece5563efdeafd366951d846525d547cb1418ff5a76aee978f47e4d11cec", "ja": "ああ、素敵だと思う。\nエミリーらしい、唯一無二の映像にしような！", "zh": "啊，我觉得很棒。\n就拍成一段属于艾米莉、独一无二的影像吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0514_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "5452741f16b08c0b0ab002276c26c41451e895b668999a86ba574826ed8f416d", "ja": "はい！　今のこの気持ちも、しっかりお伝えできるよう\n……撮影も頑張りますね、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "好的！为了把此刻的心情也充分传达给大家……我也会努力拍摄的，制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
